{"id":"gh-75","title":"want: principled approach (fulfillment plan building) \u0026 ability to show plan as json","description":"want should ask before using mise to install something. in fact 'want' should use the same mechanism for satisfying the requirement to \"install a tool\" as for other requirements. it should decide on an installation plan (which is a DAG probably or maybe just a list of steps) and then present the plan to the user. also add an option to show the plan as json instead of executing it.","status":"closed","priority":3,"issue_type":"task","created_at":"2025-10-16T20:30:57.218309+02:00","updated_at":"2025-10-16T20:30:57.218309+02:00"}
