{"id":"gh-80","title":"want: detect that rosetta is needed","description":"eg. if i do `want json ...` it knows to get `jc` but it doesn't know that `jc` won't run because i dont have rosetta on this arm mac\n\nit must detect this (by checking whether installed binaries are x86-only) and include installing rosetta in the fulfillment plan: `softwareupdate --install-rosetta`\n\nof course this all must be confirmed with the user","status":"open","priority":1,"issue_type":"bug","created_at":"2025-10-16T20:30:57.215541+02:00","updated_at":"2025-10-16T20:30:57.215541+02:00"}
